### Get my AI history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ai/suggestions/my?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get my AI history by type
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ai/suggestions/my/filter?suggestionType=BODY_ANALYSIS&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get my AI history by status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ai/suggestions/my/filter?status=SUCCESS&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get my AI history by type and status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ai/suggestions/my/filter?suggestionType=FULL_PLAN&status=SUCCESS&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Apply workout plan
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ai/suggestions/25/apply-workout-plan
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}